    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## The Digital Lawyer\r\n\r\nThis bot focuses purely on logic and facts.\r\n\r\n1. Import your guide from the Backpack and add it to the chat.\r\n\r\n2. State your case. Tell the bot your most important rule or tip for using AI.\r\n\r\n3. Ask it to check your evidence. Try asking: \"Can you find any holes in my guidance?\" or \"Do you believe my advice?\"\r\n\r\n4. If the Digital Lawyer pushes back, don't give up! Prove them wrong by pointing to the actual AI examples and screenshots you tested.\r\n",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
